{"s":57,"v":[{"t":"Whatever is in the heavens and earth exalts Allāh, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["سَبَّحَ","Glorifies","sabbaḥa",""],["لِلَّهِ","[to] Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["مَا","whatever","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","and the earth","wal-arḍi","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزُ",130]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمُ",133]]]]},{"t":"His is the dominion of the heavens and earth. He gives life and causes death, and He is over all things competent.","w":[["لَهُۥ","For Him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["مُلْكُ","(is the) dominion","mul'ku",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","(of) the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","and the earth","wal-arḍi","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["يُحْىِۦ","He gives life","yuḥ'yī",""],["وَيُمِيتُ","and causes death","wayumītu","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["يُمِيتُ",484]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["عَلَىٰ","(is) over","ʿalā",""],["كُلِّ","all","kulli",""],["شَىْءٍۢ","things","shayin",""],["قَدِيرٌ","All-Powerful","qadīrun",""]]},{"t":"He is the First and the Last, the Ascendant and the Intimate, and He is, of all things, Knowing.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلْأَوَّلُ","(is) the First","l-awalu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَوَّلُ",155]]],["وَٱلْـَٔاخِرُ","and the Last","wal-ākhiru","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["ـَٔاخِرُ",89]]],["وَٱلظَّـٰهِرُ","and the Apparent","wal-ẓāhiru","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["ظَّـٰهِرُ",985]]],["وَٱلْبَاطِنُ","and the Unapparent","wal-bāṭinu","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["بَاطِنُ",1752]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["بِكُلِّ","(is) of every","bikulli","",[["بِ",10],["كُلِّ",43]]],["شَىْءٍ","thing","shayin",""],["عَلِيمٌ","All-Knower","ʿalīmun",""]]},{"t":"It is He who created the heavens and earth in six days and then established Himself above the Throne. He knows what penetrates into the earth and what emerges from it and what descends from the heaven and what ascends therein; and He is with you wherever you are. And Allāh, of what you do, is Seeing.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["خَلَقَ","created","khalaqa",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضَ","and the earth","wal-arḍa","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضَ",35]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["سِتَّةِ","six","sittati",""],["أَيَّامٍۢ","periods","ayyāmin",""],["ثُمَّ","then","thumma",""],["ٱسْتَوَىٰ","He rose","is'tawā",""],["عَلَى","over","ʿalā",""],["ٱلْعَرْشِ","the Throne","l-ʿarshi","ۚ",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَرْشِ",388]]],["يَعْلَمُ","He knows","yaʿlamu",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["يَلِجُ","penetrates","yaliju",""],["فِى","in(to)","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَخْرُجُ","comes forth","yakhruju",""],["مِنْهَا","from it","min'hā","",[["مِنْ",6],["هَا",22]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَنزِلُ","descends","yanzilu",""],["مِنَ","from","mina",""],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ","the heaven","l-samāi","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَعْرُجُ","ascends","yaʿruju",""],["فِيهَا","therein","fīhā","ۖ",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["مَعَكُمْ","(is) with you","maʿakum","",[["مَعَ",84],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَيْنَ","wherever","ayna",""],["مَا","wherever","mā",""],["كُنتُمْ","you are","kuntum","ۚ",[["كُن",21],["تُمْ",4]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["تَعْمَلُونَ","you do","taʿmalūna","",[["تَعْمَلُ",58],["ونَ",4]]],["بَصِيرٌۭ","(is) All-seer","baṣīrun",""]]},{"t":"His is the dominion of the heavens and earth. And to Allāh are returned [all] matters.","w":[["لَّهُۥ","For Him","lahu","",[["لَّ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["مُلْكُ","(is the) dominion","mul'ku",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","(of) the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","and the earth","wal-arḍi","ۚ",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَإِلَى","and to","wa-ilā","",[["وَ",1],["إِلَى",26]]],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["تُرْجَعُ","will be returned","tur'jaʿu",""],["ٱلْأُمُورُ","the matters","l-umūru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أُمُورُ",82]]]]},{"t":"He causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night, and He is Knowing of that within the breasts.","w":[["يُولِجُ","He merges","yūliju",""],["ٱلَّيْلَ","the night","al-layla","",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلَ",150]]],["فِى","into","fī",""],["ٱلنَّهَارِ","the day","l-nahāri","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّهَارِ",219]]],["وَيُولِجُ","and He merges","wayūliju","",[["وَ",1],["يُولِجُ",865]]],["ٱلنَّهَارَ","the day","l-nahāra","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّهَارَ",219]]],["فِى","into","fī",""],["ٱلَّيْلِ","the night","al-layli","ۚ",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["عَلِيمٌۢ","(is) All-Knower","ʿalīmun",""],["بِذَاتِ","of what is in the breasts","bidhāti","",[["بِ",10],["ذَاتِ",87]]],["ٱلصُّدُورِ","of what is in the breasts","l-ṣudūri","",[["ٱل",2],["صُّدُورِ",275]]]]},{"t":"Believe in Allāh and His Messenger and spend out of that in which He has made you successive inheritors. For those who have believed among you and spent, there will be a great reward.","w":[["ءَامِنُوا۟","Believe","āminū","",[["ءَامِنُ",30],["وا۟",4]]],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah","bil-lahi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱللَّهِ",9]]],["وَرَسُولِهِۦ","and His Messenger","warasūlihi","",[["وَ",1],["رَسُولِ",47],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَأَنفِقُوا۟","and spend","wa-anfiqū","",[["وَ",1],["أَنفِقُ",190],["وا۟",4]]],["مِمَّا","of what","mimmā","",[["مِ",6],["مَّا",12]]],["جَعَلَكُم","He has made you","jaʿalakum","",[["جَعَلَ",45],["كُم",4]]],["مُّسْتَخْلَفِينَ","trustees","mus'takhlafīna",""],["فِيهِ","therein","fīhi","ۖ",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["فَٱلَّذِينَ","And those","fa-alladhīna","",[["فَ",7],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["ءَامَنُوا۟","who believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["مِنكُمْ","among you","minkum","",[["مِن",6],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَأَنفَقُوا۟","and spend","wa-anfaqū","",[["وَ",1],["أَنفَقُ",190],["وا۟",3]]],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["أَجْرٌۭ","(is) a reward","ajrun",""],["كَبِيرٌۭ","great","kabīrun",""]]},{"t":"And why do you not believe in Allāh while the Messenger invites you to believe in your Lord and He has taken your covenant, if you should [truly] be believers?","w":[["وَمَا","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["لَكُمْ","(is) for you","lakum","",[["لَ",8],["كُمْ",4]]],["لَا","(that) not","lā",""],["تُؤْمِنُونَ","you believe","tu'minūna","",[["تُؤْمِنُ",30],["ونَ",4]]],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah","bil-lahi","ۙ",[["بِ",10],["ٱللَّهِ",9]]],["وَٱلرَّسُولُ","while the Messenger","wal-rasūlu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["رَّسُولُ",47]]],["يَدْعُوكُمْ","calls you","yadʿūkum","",[["يَدْعُو",81],["كُمْ",4]]],["لِتُؤْمِنُوا۟","that you believe","litu'minū","",[["لِ",8],["تُؤْمِنُ",30],["وا۟",4]]],["بِرَبِّكُمْ","in your Lord","birabbikum","",[["بِ",10],["رَبِّ",24],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَقَدْ","and indeed","waqad","",[["وَ",1],["قَدْ",37]]],["أَخَذَ","He has taken","akhadha",""],["مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ","your covenant","mīthāqakum","",[["مِيثَـٰقَ",437],["كُمْ",4]]],["إِن","if","in",""],["كُنتُم","you are","kuntum","",[["كُن",21],["تُم",4]]],["مُّؤْمِنِينَ","believers","mu'minīna",""]]},{"t":"It is He who sends down upon His Servant [Muḥammad (ﷺ)] verses of clear evidence that He may bring you out from darknesses into the light. And indeed, Allāh is to you Kind and Merciful.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["يُنَزِّلُ","sends down","yunazzilu",""],["عَلَىٰ","upon","ʿalā",""],["عَبْدِهِۦٓ","His slave","ʿabdihi","",[["عَبْدِ",105],["هِۦٓ",5]]],["ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","Verses","āyāt